                     |CKBChapter 11 - Rules and Feedback
                    |BKB-----------------------------------

|YKO|YKBhelp rules|YKO is the authoritative rules document. Read it in full.
The essentials include:

  |WKB*|YKO Obey staff requests; raise concerns with a higher staff member
    after complying.
  |WKB*|YKO Report bugs and never exploit one. If something seems too good to
    be true, stop and ask.
  |WKB*|YKO Harassment, slurs, threats, and bypassing another player's ignore
    are not tolerated.
  |WKB*|YKO Use only the main character and additional characters permitted by
    the registered multichar system, and log in only one registered character
    at a time.
  |WKB*|YKO Unattended botting, automated killing, and automated keepalive
    activity are forbidden.
  |WKB*|YKO Do not steal another player's active kill, equipment, or money.
  |WKB*|YKO Player killing has additional rules; read |YKBhelp pk|YKO before
    participating.

Use |YKBignore <player>|YKO when you need distance. Use
|YKBvirginears on|YKO to enable the profanity filter; typing
|YKBvirginears|YKO by itself reports its current state.

Good reports help improve the game:

  |YKBbug <description>|YKO            Report a gameplay bug
  |YKBtypo <description>|YKO           Report a typo
  |YKBidea <description>|YKO           Suggest an improvement
  |YKBclientbug <description>|YKO      Report a Darkflow/client problem

Include what you did, what you expected, what happened, and the room or object
involved. Never keep using a suspected exploit while waiting for an answer.|000

